            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kokaru loka akaisaarei ka luuni loka Yoas okoku loka Akasia, ekabaka loka Yuda, kogeu Yekoakas okoku loka Yeku airum Isirael koSamaria, kirumak ikar itomon ka lukanykaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiswama nueroko kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT, kotupa aronisio nuka Yeroboam okoku loka Nebat, nuetidiakaria Isirael; mam abu konyou kanun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinep anyunyura naka EJAKAIT aluikin Isirael, kijaik kes akan naka Kasael ekabaka loka Suria, ka akan da naka Ben-kadad okoku loka Kasael apaarasia kere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
