          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kokaru loka akaisauni ka lukanykaarei loka Yoas ekabaka loka Yuda, kogeu Yekoas okoku loka Yekoakas airum Isirael koSamaria, kirumak ikar itomon kalukanykape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiswama nueroko kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT; mam abu konyou karonisio kere nuka Yeroboam okoku loka Nebat, nuetidiakaria Isirael: konye kolosenenei kanun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aswamisio ace nuka Yoas, ka nuabu kiswama kere, ka akegogoŋ naetijio Amasia ekabaka loka Yuda, mam kereka iwadikatai oitabo loka aisiitonokin nuka ikabakan luka Isirael? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
