              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodekakin Elisa adek nakatwanare: kobu Yoas ekabaka loka Isirael neejai, komonyak ŋes, kotema atiar, “Ipapa, ipapa, agalin nuka Isirael ka ikebwanenokoke!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
