        {
          "text": "Konyunyurik etuŋanan loka Edeke ŋes, kotema atiar, “Tikinom irwan akany arai irwan akanykape; asa tikidany Suria aitodol neimudiaria ŋes: asa do kwana jo idanyi Suria irwan auni bon.”",
